OL,3,GNEWSAFree park bikes moved after spate
OL,4,Aof vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team behind a scheme which allows
OL,7,Fchildren to practice cycling skills in
OL,8,Fa safe environment has had to move its
OL,9,Fbikes from public view after instances
OL,10,Fof vandalism.
OL,12,FThe Health Improvement Commission's
OL,13,FBeActive team offers free balance bikes
OL,14,Ffor youngsters to use in Guernsey parks
OL,15,Fvia its Bike Box initiative.
OL,17,FBeau Sejour park has recently faced
OL,18,Fproblems with the scheme however,
OL,19,Fincluding bikes being taken, "pulled
OL,20,Fapart" and abandoned.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
