OL,4,Aof vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FActive travel officer at the
OL,7,Fcommission, Amy Woollaston, told BBC
OL,8,FRadio Guernsey: "It seems like early
OL,9,Fevening or possibly later into the
OL,10,Fevening that older children are taking
OL,11,Fthem.
